# The packages of the CLI's lens and ASA tests (the tests/atlas subset of
# test.yml), from a hashed lock: the CPU-only torch from PyTorch's index, the
# lens service's requirements, and huggingface_hub, which `atlas lens publish`
# and `atlas asa publish` take when it is installed. A package that ci.txt also
# holds keeps its version there, because the job installs ci.txt first.
# The lens's own tests (services/geometric-lens/tests) do not use this lock:
# they install the image's lock, services/geometric-lens/requirements-lock.txt,
# on the image's Python 3.13.
# Make lens.txt again with scripts/ci/ci-lock.sh.
--index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
--extra-index-url https://pypi.org/simple
-c ci.txt
-r ../../services/geometric-lens/requirements.txt
huggingface_hub
